{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>The Gaon [Saadia] said, \"My face.\"</b> [Meaning] my anger, like ופניה לא היו לה עוד (1 Samuel 1:18). But then what will he do with the phrase אין פניך הולכים (Exodus 33:15)? In my opinion, פני means I myself, like ופניך הולכים בקרב (2 Samuel 17:11)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:40:02.892684533Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}